						<leaderTitleMale>First Pandit</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Pandit</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Varuna&lt;/color&gt; fashioned every man and woman personally. Each one is a unique and precious artwork by his divine hand. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Varuna&lt;/color&gt; said to all, "Each and every one of you is a unique and holy being formed in my image." Humanity's suffering brought &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Varuna&lt;/color&gt; to terrible grief.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% fashioned every man and woman personally. Each one is a unique and precious artwork by %%deity0_possessive%% divine hand. %%Deity0_name%% said to all, "Each and every one of you is a unique and holy being formed in my image." Humanity's suffering brought %%deity0_name%% to terrible grief.</descriptionTemplate>
