						<leaderTitleFemale>High Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt; gave birth to humans in a grand accident, and looked upon them with curiosity. Humanity's suffering brought &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt; to terrible grief. The Creator of the Universe &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt; gave to her chosen followers the gift of red hunger, so that they might know true strength.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% gave birth to humans in a grand accident, and looked upon them with curiosity. Humanity's suffering brought %%deity0_name%% to terrible grief. The %%deity0_type%% %%deity0_name%% gave to %%deity0_possessive%% chosen followers the gift of red hunger, so that they might know true strength.</descriptionTemplate>
