						<name>Neo-Sinism</name>
						<adjective>sinist</adjective>
						<memberName>Sinner</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Divine Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>For an eternity, there was a world of red water, until &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Toseabai&lt;/color&gt; created the planets and stars. The believers went forth and conquered, burned, and raped for a thousand years, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Toseabai&lt;/color&gt;'s grief at their depravity consumed her. Humanity's suffering brought &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Toseabai&lt;/color&gt; to terrible grief.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>For an eternity, there was a world of red water, until %%deity0_name%% created the planets and stars. The believers went forth and conquered, burned, and raped for a thousand years, and %%deity0_name%%'s grief at their depravity consumed %%deity0_objective%%. Humanity's suffering brought %%deity0_name%% to terrible grief.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>TribalB</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkTeal</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.451, 0.919, 0.481, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
