						<name>Animal Pack</name>
						<adjective>ideological</adjective>
						<memberName>Ideologist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Awoken Thug</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Awoken Thug</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Luke 'Lacks' Ackroyd lived in the forest for twenty years, studying the animals and connecting with them. She came to understand their true morality and founded our movement. One day while walking the streets, Lacks was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Lacks went to commune with the animals in the fields and forests, and connected with them as equals.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Luke 'Lacks' Ackroyd lived in the forest for twenty years, studying the animals and connecting with them. She came to understand their true morality and founded our movement. One day while walking the streets, Lacks was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Lacks went to commune with the animals in the fields and forests, and connected with them as equals.</descriptionTemplate>
