						<name>Chelisi Way</name>
						<adjective>powerist</adjective>
						<memberName>Poweror</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Universe Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Universe Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>A parallel universe of spirits lies next to our own. A seemingly inanimate object in this universe corresponds to an animated spirit in the other. Powerful spirits decide who is fit to rule, and lend power to those who subjugate others. An ancient text says that a new order will be created when one supreme ruler commands all of humanity.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>A parallel universe of spirits lies next to our own. A seemingly inanimate object in this universe corresponds to an animated spirit in the other. Powerful spirits decide who is fit to rule, and lend power to those who subjugate others. An ancient text says that a new order will be created when one supreme ruler commands all of humanity.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>RoundD</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkPurple</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.850, 0.054, 0.054, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Animist</li>
							<li>Supremacist</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>slavery</name>
								<def>Slavery_Honorable</def>
								<ID>249</ID>
								<randomSeed>371276184</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Requiem of Power</name>
								<def>Funeral</def>
								<ID>250</ID>
								<randomSeed>1967505836</randomSeed>
