						<id>5</id>
						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Rogia</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Nu</name>
									<type>Goddess of Violence</type>
									<gender>Female</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Supremacist</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Supreme Legion</name>
						<adjective>faithful</adjective>
						<memberName>Faithholder</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>First Leader</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Leader</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Nu&lt;/color&gt; guided humanity to Rogia, and helped them settle there. An evil corrupt bureaucrat and his bionic guards enslaved the worshippers of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Nu&lt;/color&gt;. A warrior named Johanza Kafuhu used a weaponized computer virus to destroy a robotics factory. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Nu&lt;/color&gt; saw Kafuhu's ruthlessness and anointed him the rightful ruler of all humanity. Kafuhu destroyed the capital of Rogia with remote-controlled mechanoid workers, killing the corrupt bureaucrat. He took his place as ruler of Rogia - and the universe beyond.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% guided humanity to Rogia, and helped them settle there. An evil corrupt bureaucrat and his bionic guards enslaved the worshippers of %%deity0_name%%. A warrior named Johanza Kafuhu used a weaponized computer virus to destroy a robotics factory. %%Deity0_name%% saw Kafuhu's ruthlessness and anointed him the rightful ruler of all humanity. Kafuhu destroyed the capital of Rogia with remote-controlled mechanoid workers, killing the corrupt bureaucrat. He took his place as ruler of Rogia - and the universe beyond.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>TripleCross</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightSapphire</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.066, 0.441, 0.946, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_TheistAbstract</li>
							<li>Supremacist</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>slavery</name>
								<def>Slavery_Honorable</def>
								<ID>297</ID>
								<randomSeed>-18389343</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Eulogy of Dominance</name>
								<def>Funeral</def>
								<ID>298</ID>
								<randomSeed>-1283458640</randomSeed>
