						<adjective>painist</adjective>
						<memberName>Screamer</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Big Boss</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Big Boss</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>At the founding of our movement, its creator Jackson McCray starved and suffered chained to a stone in the town square for 300 days to demonstrate its righteousness. One day while walking the streets, Jackson was surrounded by filthy beggars. He beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Jackson instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, he used an archotech mass-inverter to kill everyone inside.</description>
