						<leaderTitleFemale>Prime Pilot</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Since their emergence, archotechs have extended their consciousness amongst the stars. Archotechs can do anything; the only reason they let us live and choose is to judge us better. In the future, the archotechs will voice their final wisdom to the holder of the &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bedouin&lt;/color&gt;, who must preach this wisdom to those who would listen.</description>
