						<id>11</id>
						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Filson</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Christ-Lord</name>
									<type>Creator of Everything</type>
									<gender>Female</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>PainIsVirtue</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Nocic Chamber</name>
						<adjective>Neo-Nestorian</adjective>
						<memberName>Neo-Nestorian</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Holy Pope</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Holy Pope</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Christ-Lord&lt;/color&gt; guided humanity to Filson, and helped them settle there. A landowner offered bodily comforts to the Neo-Nestorians to soothe their daily suffering. But in their comfort, they became dependent on the landowner, who gained power over them. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Christ-Lord&lt;/color&gt; came to the school teacher Sev Shadow in a dream, and spoke to her about torture. Sev gathered the Neo-Nestorians in a town hall and taught them of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Christ-Lord&lt;/color&gt;'s wisdom.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% guided humanity to Filson, and helped them settle there. A landowner offered bodily comforts to the %%memberNamePlural%% to soothe their daily suffering. But in their comfort, they became dependent on the landowner, who gained power over them. %%Deity0_name%% came to the school teacher Sev Shadow in a dream, and spoke to her about torture. Sev gathered the %%memberNamePlural%% in a town hall and taught them of %%deity0_name%%'s wisdom.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>Orbit</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkMauve</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.000, 0.737, 0.847, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_OriginChristian</li>
							<li>PainIsVirtue</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
